# Only what the Dockerfiles copy goes into the build context (#223 C11-5).
# Without this every build shipped the whole checkout (.git, logs, build/,
# local data) to the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!shepherd_base
!shepherd_broker
!shepherd_db
!shepherd_server
!shepherd_utils
!workers
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
workers/*/debug
